└── LICENSE
```

## Continuous integration

GitHub Actions runs on every push to `main` and on every pull request:

- **Lint**: all pre-commit hooks (ruff check, ruff format, mypy `--strict`, file hygiene).
- **Test**: `pytest` with coverage on every supported Python version; the `coverage.xml` report is uploaded as a build artifact.

Both jobs install dependencies with `uv sync --locked`. Actions are pinned to commit SHAs (with the version in a comment) and [Dependabot](.github/dependabot.yml) opens weekly PRs to update actions, Python dependencies and pre-commit hooks.

